"You will take part in the consulting services we provide to our partners and "
"customers: design, analysis, development, testing, project management, "
"support/coaching. You will work autonomously as well as coordinate and "
"supervise small distributed development teams for some projects. Optionally, "
"you will deliver Odoo training sessions to partners and customers (8-10 "
"people/session). You will report to the Head of Professional Services and "
"work closely with all developers and consultants.\n"
"\n"
"The job is located in Grand-Rosière (1367), Belgium (between Louvain-La-"
"Neuve and Namur)."
msgstr ""
"Sodelovali boste v svetovalnih storitvah, ki jih nudimo našim partnerjem in "
"strankam: načrtovanje, analiza, razvoj, testiranje, vodenje projektov, "
"podpora/mentorstvo. Delali boste samostojno ter koordinirali in nadzorovali "
"majhne porazdeljene razvojne ekipe za nekatere projekte. Po želji boste "
"izvajali usposabljanja za Odoo za partnerje in stranke (8–10 oseb/sejo). "
"Poročali boste vodji strokovnih storitev in tesno sodelovali z vsemi "
"razvijalci in svetovalci.\n"
"\n"
"Delovno mesto se nahaja v Grand-Rosière (1367) v Belgiji (med Louvain-La-"
"Neuve in Namurjem)."
